# {{SKILL_NAME}}

Use `jj {{JJ_ALIAS_NAME}}` as the required pre-planned-edits task ledger for Codex work.

Before changing files, Codex must call:

```sh
jj {{JJ_ALIAS_NAME}} $'<goal>\n<plan>'
```

The message contains only:

1. a short goal on the first line
2. the plan body starting on the second line

The alias formats the stored change description with the plan heading.
